I want the animation to respond continuously to the user's scroll position. Fast scrolling should feel slightly more dynamic, while slow scrolling should allow the animation to settle smoothly.

Use appropriate easing, spring physics, interpolation, velocity-based movement, or other techniques where they improve the effect.

